       cept for the --vv and --hh options. If options are specified on the comman‐
       dline, the options on the commandline take precedence over the  options
       in the configfile.

       Normally  NNSSDD should be started with the `nsd-control(8) start` command
       invoked from a _/_e_t_c_/_r_c_._d_/_n_s_d_._s_h script or similar at the operating sys‐
       tem startup.

